  "limits": [
    "Requests are synthetic and never sent. Browser transports only; server-side SSAI is outside scope.",
    "Query permutations and publisher proxy paths are controlled transformations of documented wire formats, not asserted SDK default serialization.",
    "Opaque/body-only cases remain in the primary denominator. Functional observable twins constrain broad blocking.",
    "Canonical vendor routes and existing list matches remain in the score. All required-list snapshots are identical between versions.",
    "No scores for cookie/header sanitation, visual hiding, native-proxy revocation, SDK retries, subsequent requests, or overall web privacy."
  ],
